      "card_ids": ["C13", "C02", "C35", "C36", "C24"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "The query combines an isothiazole S-oxide scaffold with an activated aryl chloride, paralleling both the isothiazolinone sensitizer family and DNCB; the weak/negative DNTB context is structurally distinct and produced only weak sensitization at very high dose, so it does not override the positive transferable evidence.",
      "card_ids": ["C22", "C27"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "Additional positive human patch-test outcomes for aromatic amines and hair-dye components are consistent with, but less directly transferable to, the query.",
